svent-bspwm (0.6.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Couple with svent-artwork orca wallpapers; promote svent-core, svent-artwork,
    picom, feh and x11 utilities to Depends so a working desktop is guaranteed.
  * Network module identifies any NIC by kernel metadata (vpn, ethernet, wifi,
    usb tethering, mobile/WWAN, virtual, other) instead of name prefixes.
  * Supersede the sv-bspwm package (Conflicts/Replaces/Provides).

 -- z1rov <fabian@zirov.net>  Tue, 07 Oct 2026 21:00:00 -0500

svent-bspwm (0.4.6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Wallpaper picker (super+w) is now a thumbnail grid and also lists the
    user's own wallpapers from ~/Pictures/Wallpapers.
  * bspwmrc applies the saved wallpaper choice, so a user's own wallpaper
    survives restarts and reinstalls (the choice lives in ~/.config/svent,
    which the config sync never touches).
  * postinst sets zsh as the login shell for root and existing users.

