svent-bspwm (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ship a vanilla .zshrc in /etc/skel: no oh-my-zsh or prompt framework.
    Git branch via zsh vcs_info, plus zsh-autosuggestions and
    zsh-syntax-highlighting sourced from Debian packages when present.
  * Recommend zsh-autosuggestions, zsh-syntax-highlighting, bat and eza.
  * Set the Polybar bar corner radius to 8.

