svent-bspwm (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ship the full z1rov bspwm rice as /etc/skel dotfiles: bspwmrc, sxhkd
    keybindings, a Polybar bar with status scripts, Dunst notifications,
    Picom compositor, a Kitty terminal on zsh, and Rofi menus.
  * Bundle the Z1rov Workspace font and register it on install.
  * Drop the old /etc/xdg configs; a new user now gets a working desktop.
  * Clean the bspwmrc and sxhkdrc of personal-only helper scripts.

